      "description": "<p>View Profile Information</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><b>Issue Type:</b> Story</li>\n\t<li><b>Summary:</b> User can view their basic profile details on a dedicated page.</li>\n\t<li><b>Description:</b>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><b>As a</b> logged-in user,</li>\n\t\t<li><b>I want to</b> see my name, email address, and profile picture,</li>\n\t\t<li><b>So that</b> I know my current account status.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Page loads within 2 seconds.</li>\n\t\t<li>Displays user name, email, and avatar image.</li>\n\t\t<li>If no avatar exists, show a default placeholder icon.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
